{"title": "Death Burst: Fire", "pageid": 30134, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Death_Burst:_Fire", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Fire.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/43/Generic_Fire.webp/300px-Generic_Fire.webp, /w/images/4/43/Generic_Fire.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/43/Generic_Fire.webp/300px-Generic_Fire.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/43/Generic_Fire.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Death Burst: Fire</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Magma_Mephit\" title=\"Magma Mephit\">Magma Mephit</a> passive feature. If the Magma Mephit dies, it automatically explodes, dealing fire damage to all nearby creatures.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When the mephit dies, it explodes in a burst of lava that deals <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">2d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> damage to all creatures within 2 m (7 ft). \n</p><p>On a successful save, the creatures still take half damage.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Magma_Mephit\" title=\"Magma Mephit\">Magma Mephit</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Young_Magma_Mephit\" title=\"Young Magma Mephit\">Young Magma Mephit</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714213509\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.030 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.034 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 754/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 4120/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2327/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 21/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 226/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643720/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   28.969      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   28.969      1 -total\n 36.18%   10.482      1 Template:DamageText\n 32.18%    9.321      1 Template:Damage_type\n 31.16%    9.026      1 Template:Icon_link\n 30.07%    8.712      1 Template:Icon_text\n 28.09%    8.137      7 Template:Trim\n 22.46%    6.506      1 Template:Ifempty\n 14.02%    4.060      1 Template:Main_namespace_only\n 12.99%    3.762      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:30134-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714213509 and revision id 374892. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n<